WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Emulator, Quest 3. A light peeks over the armchair; depth occlusion hides the rest.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.900
Point the hand ray and pinch. The light pops, then lands on your palm.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:14.500
Then it rises to your ceiling.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.800
It lands as a star, and a line joins it to the last one.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:26.800
Five catches later, the constellation on your ceiling has grown.
